  GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}, "Rows" -> {{Top}}},
  GridBoxDividers->{
   "Rows" -> {{True, False, False, False}}, 
    "Columns" -> {{True, False, False, False, False}}}]], "Output",ExpressionU\
UID->"b5710630-dec3-4c0c-ab1f-7459a4051d97"],

Cell["Fourier Dip Depth Comparison", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f0cd5220-05b7-4a5a-8d4a-47aa8003ff50"],

Cell["\<\
The Ulam sequence achieves ~30\[Times] deeper dips than Bose Sidon sets or \
random controls.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c1ed0937-7cb3-4b8c-9ffe-3bd18bd5041f"],

