Cell["Conclusion", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7fa93ce9-b993-4500-8f52-65665d8a85d6"],

Cell["\<\
The Ulam sequence's deep hidden-\[Alpha] Fourier dip (~\[Minus]0.797) is NOT \
reproduced by Bose-Chowla Sidon-set constructions. All tested Sidon \
constructions produce shallow dips (\[Minus]0.02 to \[Minus]0.013) comparable \
to random density-matched controls, confirming that the Ulam phenomenon is \
specific to the Ulam construction, not to generic sparsity or \
pairwise-sum-uniqueness.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1b9bd573-e13b-4aea-9a52-8a54793b6b5c"]
},
